# description: Change Pub/Sub subscription subscription-1 in project acme-prod (subscription.messageRetentionDuration)
PATCH /v1/projects/acme-prod/subscriptions/subscription-1 HTTP/1.1
Host: pubsub.googleapis.com
Authorization: Bearer opf_EXAMPLE_google_access_token
Content-Type: application/json

{"subscription": {"messageRetentionDuration": "x"}}
